    "text": "wgxa.tv\nwebsite\nWarner Robins\nBritish man to serve life in prison for murdering his wife in Warner Robins\nBy Leah Kincaid and Carlos Stephens,\n6 hours agoHOUSTON COUNTY, Ga. (WGXA) — A British man will serve life in prison for murdering his wife in Warner Robins after attempting to cover up her death. Houston County District Attorney Eric Edwards says a jury convicted 57-year-old Brian McManus of murder on Saturday, July 12. The investigation into McManus began in November 2023, after he made a call to 911 claiming his wife, 63-year-old Lucille Ann McManus, had committed suicide.",
